Use SOM CNL version 1.
Use prompt version 7.
Use package app_projects.
Bind contract related-flow.v1 with SHA-256 "716ae3f08c8ca79b50f757884b9140acc842d2213157c51ea4b9fd3b17d92091".
Begin parent resource.
Use resource name Project.
Use table projects.
Use path "/projects".
Field name is required str and is not unique.
Field description is optional str and is not unique with default null.
Begin query.
Use no exact filter.
Use no date filter.
Limit query results to 20.
End query.
End parent resource.
Begin child resource.
Use resource name Todo.
Use table todos.
Use path "/todos".
Field title is required str and is not unique.
Field description is optional str and is not unique with default null.
Field completed is optional bool and is not unique with default false.
Field due_on is optional date and is not unique with default null.
Field external_code is required str and is unique.
Begin query.
Filter exactly on field completed.
Filter before date on field due_on.
Limit query results to 100.
End query.
End child resource.
Relate child to parent with foreign key project_id and restrict deletion.
Use migration revision related80000.
Use no previous migration revision.
Begin capabilities.
Use database postgresql.
Use authentication jwt.
Use object storage none.
Use workflow json_export.
Use no workflow value field.
Use no workflow group field.
End capabilities.
Begin routes.
Allow create on parent.
Allow get on parent.
Allow list on parent.
Allow patch on parent.
Allow delete on parent.
Allow create on child.
Allow get on child.
Allow list on child.
Allow patch on child.
Allow delete on child.
Allow batch creation.
End routes.
Begin flow choose_label.
Input parent has type parent_input.
Input child has type child_input.
Input patch has type child_patch.
Begin steps.
Begin step auth with operation authorize.
On failure, use no undo.
End step auth.
Begin transaction write.
Begin step made with operation parent.create.
Set argument data to input parent.
On failure, undo with delete_created.
End step made.
Begin step added with operation child.create.
Set argument parent_id to step made field "id".
Set argument data to input child.
On failure, undo with delete_created.
End step added.
Begin step patched with operation child.patch.
Set argument parent_id to step made field "id".
Set argument child_id to step added field "id".
Set argument data to input patch.
On failure, undo with restore_patch.
End step patched.
End transaction write.
Begin branch choose when step added field "description" is null.
Begin then.
End then.
Begin else.
End else.
Export label from then literal string "empty" and from else step added field "description".
End branch choose.
End steps.
Return label from step label field "".
End flow choose_label.
End request.
